###Hämta FaultReports

GET {{FSab_HostAddress}}/api/FaultReports
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}

###Hämta FaultReports med ID

GET {{FSab_HostAddress}}/api/FaultReports/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}


###Skapa FaultReports

POST {{FSab_HostAddress}}/api/FaultReports
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}
{
  "Title": "Test Fault Report6",
  "Description": "This is a test fault report created via the API."
}

###Updatera FaultReports

PUT {{FSab_HostAddress}}/api/FaultReports/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}
{
  "Title": "UpdatedTest Fault Report",
  "Description": "This is a updated test fault report created via the API.",
  "Status": 1
}

###Ta bort FaultReports

DELETE {{FSab_HostAddress}}/api/FaultReports/5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}

###AZURE

### Hämta FaultReports från Azure

GET {{FSab_azure}}/api/FaultReports
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}

###Skapa FaultReports via azure

POST {{FSab_azure}}/api/FaultReports
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}
{
  "Title": "Test Fault Report6",
  "Description": "This is a test fault report created via the API."
}

###Hämta FaultReports med ID via Azure

GET {{FSab_azure}}/api/FaultReports/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}

###Updatera FaultReports via azure

PUT {{FSab_azure}}/api/FaultReports/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}
{
  "Title": "UpdatedTest Fault Report",
  "Description": "This is a updated test fault report created via the API.",
  "Status": 1
}

###Ta bort FaultReports via azure

DELETE {{FSab_azure}}/api/FaultReports/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{FSab_AuthToken}}